  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Pressed Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hyaluronic Acid</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A versatile powder bronzer that blends effortlessly to naturally warm and blur the complexion, with light-to-medium coverage and a sweat- and humidity-proof finish. </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Hyaluronic Acid: Provides comfortable wear and a nondrying feel.</p><p>- Spherical Powders and Smoothing Amino Acid: Provide an instant blurring effect, also found in the Soft Blur Setting Powder (sold separately).</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, and triclosan. It is also cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>- Mario's tips for all-over warmth: Use the F2 Brush (sold separately) for mistake-proof all-over application.<br><br>Mario's tips to softly sculpt:<br>-Sweep the brush across the high points of your face (where the sun naturally hits): top of the forehead, temples, apples of the cheeks, and jawline. <br>-Use the smaller end of the brush to apply to smaller areas of the face for more targeted sculpting, or across the eyelids. <br>-Use the larger end of the brush to apply under the chin and on your neck, and to even out the face and body.<br>-Sweep product from under the chin down the center of the neck for architectural sculpting. <br>-If you are a fan of Mario's SoftSculpt Bronzer, this is his new, modern version.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Mica, Magnesium Myristate, Lauroyl Lysine, Dimethicone, Calcium Sodium Borosilicate, Silica, Isodecyl Neopentanoate, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Polypropylsilsesquioxane, Caprylyl Glycol, Diisostearyl Malate, Dimethiconol, Phenoxyethanol, Hexylene Glycol, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Polyhydroxystearic acid, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Isostearic Acid, Lecithin, Polyglyceryl-3 Polyricinoleate.<br><br>May Contain/Peut Contenir: Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Manganese Violet (CI 77742).</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Pressed Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hyaluronic Acid</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A versatile powder bronzer that blends effortlessly to naturally warm and blur the complexion, with light-to-medium coverage and a sweat- and humidity-proof finish. </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Hyaluronic Acid: Provides comfortable wear and a nondrying feel.</p><p>- Spherical Powders and Smoothing Amino Acid: Provide an instant blurring effect, also found in the Soft Blur Setting Powder (sold separately).</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, and triclosan. It is also cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>- Mario's tips for all-over warmth: Use the F2 Brush (sold separately) for mistake-proof all-over application.<br><br>Mario's tips to softly sculpt:<br>-Sweep the brush across the high points of your face (where the sun naturally hits): top of the forehead, temples, apples of the cheeks, and jawline. <br>-Use the smaller end of the brush to apply to smaller areas of the face for more targeted sculpting, or across the eyelids. <br>-Use the larger end of the brush to apply under the chin and on your neck, and to even out the face and body.<br>-Sweep product from under the chin down the center of the neck for architectural sculpting. <br>-If you are a fan of Mario's SoftSculpt Bronzer, this is his new, modern version.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Mica, Magnesium Myristate, Lauroyl Lysine, Dimethicone, Calcium Sodium Borosilicate, Silica, Isodecyl Neopentanoate, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Polypropylsilsesquioxane, Caprylyl Glycol, Diisostearyl Malate, Dimethiconol, Phenoxyethanol, Hexylene Glycol, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Polyhydroxystearic acid, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Isostearic Acid, Lecithin, Polyglyceryl-3 Polyricinoleate.<br><br>May Contain/Peut Contenir: Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Manganese Violet (CI 77742).</div></details>",
